WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.041 --> 00:00:31.666
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:35.166
Lord Krishna clarified that all jīvātmās

3
00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:37.958
get trapped in the duality of
 desires and aversion.

4
00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:41.458
So now the question arises –

5
00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:46.333
can someone obtain liberation from this
 delusion, from this confusion?

6
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:48.958
This verse is the answer to this.

7
00:00:53.583 --> 00:00:57.791
Let's understand all parts of this verse –

8
00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:00.500
'Yeșām tv antagatam pāpam' –

9
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:05.458
Meaning - Those people whose
 sinful karmas have ended.

10
00:01:05.458 --> 00:01:08.458
'Janānāṁ puņya-karmaņām' –

11
00:01:08.458 --> 00:01:12.791
And those people who have done
 virtuous karmas for many births.

12
00:01:12.791 --> 00:01:15.708
'Te dvandva-moha-nirmuktā' –

13
00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.541
Such people

14
00:01:17.541 --> 00:01:20.541
become free from duality and delusion.

15
00:01:20.541 --> 00:01:23.708
'Bhajante mām dřdha-vratāḥ' –

16
00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:26.500
meaning those people, with firm vow

17
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.333
 meaning firm resolve, worship Me,

18
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:33.000
do My devotion.

19
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:34.750
Lord Krishna clarifies

20
00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:35.958
that only those people

21
00:01:35.958 --> 00:01:37.916
who have been freed from all their sins

22
00:01:37.916 --> 00:01:40.833
through virtuous karmas,

23
00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.000
only they have the power

24
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.458
of certain and complete devotion.

25
00:01:44.458 --> 00:01:47.166
And those devotees alone can be freed

26
00:01:47.166 --> 00:01:49.708
from this worldly duality and delusion.

27
00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:51.208
In this verse, Lord Krishna

28
00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:54.208
shows a path – how a human can reach

29
00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:57.208
the goal of firm devotion to Him.

30
00:01:57.208 --> 00:02:00.625
First, abandoning sinful karmas is necessary,

31
00:02:00.625 --> 00:02:01.375
because

32
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:04.250
these create obstacles in spiritual advancement

33
00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:07.833
and bind humans with material desires.

34
00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:09.083
Along with this,

35
00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:11.916
accumulation of virtuous
 karmas is also necessary,

36
00:02:11.916 --> 00:02:14.625
which takes consciousness toward advancement

37
00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:17.875
and frees from dualities' influence.

38
00:02:17.875 --> 00:02:18.750
When a person

39
00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:20.791
becomes free from these dualities,

40
00:02:20.791 --> 00:02:22.916
only then can they become absorbed

41
00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:26.375
in Lord Krishna's service
  with complete dedication.

42
00:02:26.375 --> 00:02:28.166
Along with this, many ancient

43
00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:30.291
gurus have also clarified

44
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:33.041
that along with virtuous karmas, another

45
00:02:33.041 --> 00:02:36.125
extremely important part of this progress is –

46
00:02:36.125 --> 00:02:38.000
Company of those excellent devotees

47
00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.916
who are already moving forward on this path.

48
00:02:40.916 --> 00:02:43.916
From such sacred company,
 inspiration is obtained.

49
00:02:43.916 --> 00:02:46.708
The mind becomes pure, and humans

50
00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:50.250
get help in walking on the path of firm devotion.

51
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.458
And this is the right path of liberation.

52
00:02:53.458 --> 00:02:55.916
Lord Krishna gives this assurance that one who

53
00:02:55.916 --> 00:02:57.666
will completely abandon sinful karmas,

54
00:02:57.666 --> 00:03:01.041
will adopt only virtuous karmas,

55
00:03:01.041 --> 00:03:03.500
they will obtain the supreme goal of 

56
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:07.000
Supreme Soul's devotion, and they will

57
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.625
be liberated.

58
00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.708
If you're

59
00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:17.791
wavering in your spiritual progress,

60
00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:19.125
if you're experiencing

61
00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:22.041
spiritual instability,

62
00:03:22.041 --> 00:03:24.458
then it's necessary to understand

63
00:03:24.458 --> 00:03:26.875
that there can be only two main reasons

64
00:03:26.875 --> 00:03:30.000
for this instability –

65
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.250
either

66
00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.708
you're ignoring

67
00:03:32.708 --> 00:03:35.750
proper and virtuous karmas,

68
00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.708
or in the karmas you're doing,

69
00:03:38.708 --> 00:03:43.291
sin is included somewhere.

70
00:03:43.291 --> 00:03:46.291
Meaning you're either abandoning
 virtuous karmas

71
00:03:46.291 --> 00:03:49.708
and stopping your progress,

72
00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:53.250
or going backward instead of moving forward

73
00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.333
from sinful karmas.

74
00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:59.250
This principle applies not only
 to spiritual journey

75
00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:02.333
but to every area of life.

76
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:05.916
If you must move toward the goal,

77
00:04:05.916 --> 00:04:09.500
then two things become necessary –

78
00:04:09.500 --> 00:04:11.125
First,

79
00:04:11.125 --> 00:04:14.125
make those decisions and do those karmas

80
00:04:14.125 --> 00:04:18.000
that will take you forward. And second,

81
00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.458
don't do those karmas

82
00:04:20.458 --> 00:04:23.541
that are against your progress.

83
00:04:23.541 --> 00:04:24.375
If any

84
00:04:24.375 --> 00:04:29.250
of these is missed, then progress will stop.

85
00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.541
Just take a small

86
00:04:31.541 --> 00:04:33.125
example of your health.

87
00:04:33.125 --> 00:04:36.750
If you pursue the goal of staying healthy,

88
00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.083
then some habits will increase your progress,

89
00:04:40.083 --> 00:04:42.166
and some will stop it.

90
00:04:42.166 --> 00:04:44.250
If you didn't start the karmas

91
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:48.333
of nutritious food and exercise,

92
00:04:48.333 --> 00:04:50.458
then effort won't be successful.

93
00:04:50.458 --> 00:04:54.500
Along with this, stopping some
 karmas is also necessary.

94
00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:56.125
If you keep

95
00:04:56.125 --> 00:04:58.666
being attracted to continuously unhealthy food,

96
00:04:58.666 --> 00:05:00.833
or keep staying up late at night,

97
00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:04.375
then soon your resolve will break,

98
00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:06.041
and then these very habits

99
00:05:06.041 --> 00:05:09.000
will start spoiling your health

100
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.708
instead of improving it.

101
00:05:10.708 --> 00:05:11.833
Similarly,

102
00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:13.708
if you're not seeing progress

103
00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:16.583
in your spiritual journey,

104
00:05:16.583 --> 00:05:18.500
then understand

105
00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.208
that some change is necessary.

106
00:05:21.208 --> 00:05:23.458
Will have to connect with right karmas.

107
00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:25.500
Recognizing wrong karmas,

108
00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:28.041
will have to abandon them.

109
00:05:28.041 --> 00:05:31.250
For this, firm resolve is necessary.

110
00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:34.166
But this is the difficulty –

111
00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:36.625
that in the absence of firm resolve,

112
00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:39.916
humans cannot stop wrong actions

113
00:05:39.916 --> 00:05:44.250
and cannot start good actions.

114
00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:47.791
In such a case, you'll need help.

115
00:05:47.791 --> 00:05:51.250
Will need company of some experienced person

116
00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.875
who has come out of these difficulties

117
00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:57.166
and can give you encouragement.

118
00:05:57.166 --> 00:05:59.250
Whether it's the question of personal progress

119
00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.916
or spiritual progress, whenever

120
00:06:01.916 --> 00:06:06.791
firm resolve starts wavering,
 take help of some guru.

121
00:06:06.791 --> 00:06:09.750
That guru will understand your situation

122
00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:12.958
and suggest right remedies to you.

123
00:06:12.958 --> 00:06:15.375
Keep company of devotees

124
00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:18.083
walking on the path of spirituality.

125
00:06:18.083 --> 00:06:21.750
This Gita is also always presented for you.

126
00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:26.208
This will give you inspiration and guidance too.

127
00:06:30.708 --> 00:06:32.541
In family life,

128
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:36.916
if you truly want to experience deep peace,
 sweet relationships,

129
00:06:36.916 --> 00:06:40.916
and spiritual progress,

130
00:06:40.916 --> 00:06:43.666
then you'll have to ask yourself

131
00:06:43.666 --> 00:06:45.291
these two questions.

132
00:06:45.291 --> 00:06:48.375
First, is your family

133
00:06:48.375 --> 00:06:53.666
abandoning sinful karmas? And second,

134
00:06:53.666 --> 00:06:55.500
are family members

135
00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:59.208
increasing good and virtuous karmas?

136
00:06:59.208 --> 00:07:01.625
Both these are necessary.

137
00:07:01.625 --> 00:07:03.500
Think,

138
00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.041
if in a garden some wild

139
00:07:06.041 --> 00:07:09.791
plants have taken root,

140
00:07:09.791 --> 00:07:11.416
then what will happen?

141
00:07:11.416 --> 00:07:14.166
Those wild plants will also harm

142
00:07:14.166 --> 00:07:17.458
other beautiful and healthy plants.

143
00:07:17.458 --> 00:07:20.000
So first will have to stop

144
00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.083
those wild plants' growth,

145
00:07:22.083 --> 00:07:23.833
will have to remove them.

146
00:07:23.833 --> 00:07:28.250
And then will have to plant
 new and healthy plants.

147
00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.583
If both these works are done,

148
00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:35.041
then soon the garden will flourish

149
00:07:35.041 --> 00:07:39.458
with colorful flowers and their fragrance.

150
00:07:39.458 --> 00:07:42.500
Similarly, it's extremely necessary

151
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.208
that at personal level,

152
00:07:44.208 --> 00:07:47.791
wild plants of bad karmas be stopped.

153
00:07:47.791 --> 00:07:49.666
Along with this,

154
00:07:49.666 --> 00:07:53.458
new plants of good and
 virtuous karmas be planted.

155
00:07:53.458 --> 00:07:57.083
Soon your family too will
 flourish with love's colors

156
00:07:57.083 --> 00:08:01.708
and spirituality's fragrance.

157
00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:06.958
Now see this same example from
 another perspective too.

158
00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:09.958
If some people of the family are involved in

159
00:08:09.958 --> 00:08:11.916
 inauspicious karmas or sin,

160
00:08:11.916 --> 00:08:13.583
then its influence

161
00:08:13.583 --> 00:08:16.166
will be on the family's entire garden.

162
00:08:16.166 --> 00:08:18.875
Its bad effect will also fall on those

163
00:08:18.875 --> 00:08:22.291
who are doing virtuous karmas.

164
00:08:22.291 --> 00:08:24.375
So what should be done?

165
00:08:24.375 --> 00:08:27.208
Purification.

166
00:08:27.208 --> 00:08:29.958
A human isn't some wild plant

167
00:08:29.958 --> 00:08:31.875
that must be removed.

168
00:08:31.875 --> 00:08:36.625
Change and purification are
 possible in any human.

169
00:08:36.625 --> 00:08:38.708
And this can be done.

170
00:08:38.708 --> 00:08:39.916
By inspiring

171
00:08:39.916 --> 00:08:43.083
those people toward spirituality.

172
00:08:43.083 --> 00:08:44.833
If gently

173
00:08:44.833 --> 00:08:47.541
continuous guidance is given to them.

174
00:08:47.541 --> 00:08:51.083
If at home on spiritual topics continuously

175
00:08:51.083 --> 00:08:54.666
discussion happens, if other people of the family

176
00:08:54.666 --> 00:08:57.083
connect with virtuous karmas with more faith,

177
00:08:57.083 --> 00:09:00.208
then soon because of this family

178
00:09:00.208 --> 00:09:04.083
influence, those people too will start changing

179
00:09:04.083 --> 00:09:07.666
who were earlier engaged in inauspicious works.

180
00:09:07.666 --> 00:09:10.583
They too, like other family members,

181
00:09:10.583 --> 00:09:13.583
will start connecting with good karmas.

182
00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:16.000
So whether you see personally

183
00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.833
or family-wise.

184
00:09:17.833 --> 00:09:19.958
Increasing good karmas

185
00:09:19.958 --> 00:09:22.291
and stopping bad karmas

186
00:09:22.291 --> 00:09:25.125
will take your family toward peace,

187
00:09:25.125 --> 00:09:29.583
sweet relationships, and spiritual progress.

188
00:09:34.166 --> 00:09:35.291
Those people who

189
00:09:35.291 --> 00:09:38.083
abandon sinful karmas,

190
00:09:38.083 --> 00:09:40.541
adopt virtuous karmas,

191
00:09:40.541 --> 00:09:44.083
and do devotion firmly,

192
00:09:44.083 --> 00:09:47.041
they are liberated.

193
00:09:47.041 --> 00:09:51.000
Here pay attention to three things.

194
00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:55.250
Stopping sinful karma,
 increasing virtuous karma,

195
00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:58.166
and doing devotion firmly.

196
00:09:58.166 --> 00:10:00.666
Just as these three things

197
00:10:00.666 --> 00:10:04.083
are necessary for spiritual excellence,

198
00:10:04.083 --> 00:10:07.791
similarly these same three
 things for professional

199
00:10:07.791 --> 00:10:12.291
excellence too are equally necessary.

200
00:10:12.291 --> 00:10:14.791
Let's understand this.

201
00:10:14.791 --> 00:10:19.916
You'll also agree that in professional
life, one succeeds

202
00:10:19.916 --> 00:10:23.000
who remains firm toward their goals.

203
00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:26.375
One who's not even serious about their goals,

204
00:10:26.375 --> 00:10:28.708
won't get success.

205
00:10:28.708 --> 00:10:30.916
But will this firmness

206
00:10:30.916 --> 00:10:34.875
come just by saying that from today

207
00:10:34.875 --> 00:10:38.791
I'm firm toward my goals?

208
00:10:38.791 --> 00:10:40.250
No.

209
00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:43.500
Many entanglements will
 come in professional life,

210
00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:46.708
that can break this firmness.

211
00:10:46.708 --> 00:10:49.333
This firmness will slowly increase

212
00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:52.958
when you start walking toward it.

213
00:10:52.958 --> 00:10:57.291
And for this, the first two steps are necessary.

214
00:10:57.291 --> 00:11:02.125
Stopping bad karmas and
 increasing good karmas.

215
00:11:02.125 --> 00:11:05.541
In professional context, its meaning is

216
00:11:05.541 --> 00:11:07.125
stopping those karmas

217
00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:09.000
that take away from the goal

218
00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.875
and increasing those karmas

219
00:11:10.875 --> 00:11:14.083
that move toward the goal.

220
00:11:14.083 --> 00:11:15.833
For example,

221
00:11:15.833 --> 00:11:17.750
speaking ill of others,

222
00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:20.333
wasting time unnecessarily,

223
00:11:20.333 --> 00:11:21.833
paying more attention

224
00:11:21.833 --> 00:11:24.291
to others' work than your own work.

225
00:11:24.291 --> 00:11:27.625
All these actions will become
 obstacles in progress.

226
00:11:27.625 --> 00:11:31.500
So recognize these karmas and stop them.

227
00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:35.083
Along with this, starting your day

228
00:11:35.083 --> 00:11:38.125
in a planned way.

229
00:11:38.125 --> 00:11:41.375
Completing your work on time.

230
00:11:41.375 --> 00:11:43.083
Respect for colleagues,

231
00:11:43.083 --> 00:11:46.708
helping them, and taking help from them.

232
00:11:46.708 --> 00:11:50.666
All these karmas will move toward progress.

233
00:11:50.666 --> 00:11:53.666
So these must be increased.

234
00:11:53.666 --> 00:11:57.000
And when someone keeps
 these two things in mind,

235
00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.958
then that person

236
00:11:58.958 --> 00:12:01.416
will start moving toward professional progress.

237
00:12:01.416 --> 00:12:04.041
And from this progress, toward goals

238
00:12:04.041 --> 00:12:08.333
their firmness will also automatically
 keep getting stronger.

239
00:12:08.333 --> 00:12:12.500
Just as some devotee, by stopping sin,

240
00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.166
by doing virtuous karmas,

241
00:12:14.166 --> 00:12:16.916
brings firmness in their devotion,

242
00:12:16.916 --> 00:12:20.500
and obtains Me and becomes liberated,

243
00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.833
similarly,

244
00:12:21.833 --> 00:12:25.916
by stopping bad habits and
 increasing good habits,

245
00:12:25.916 --> 00:12:26.833
some person

246
00:12:26.833 --> 00:12:28.958
toward their professional goals

247
00:12:28.958 --> 00:12:31.041
can increase firmness

248
00:12:31.041 --> 00:12:34.375
and obtain success.

249
00:12:34.375 --> 00:12:36.666
Think about this matter.
